    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Distant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the distant world of Ondarea, war machines walk the planet long after the collapse. Discover decaying cities, snow-choked military outposts, and industrial relics of a lost age\u2014each mission peeling back the truth behind the cause of the drone lands, and questioning the purpose of a connection that never truly existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylish Acrobatic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, boost, and strike with precision. Chain mobility and attacks to dismantle enemies in fast-paced encounters that reward timing, spacing, and control. Use everything you've got to complete your missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Build Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Knight\u2014body, weapons, and tuning. Each part affects how you fight and what you're capable of. Adapt your loadout, craft machines tailored to your playstyle and mission demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Distant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the distant world of Ondarea, war machines walk the planet long after the collapse. Discover decaying cities, snow-choked military outposts, and industrial relics of a lost age\u2014each mission peeling back the truth behind the cause of the drone lands, and questioning the purpose of a connection that never truly existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylish Acrobatic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, boost, and strike with precision. Chain mobility and attacks to dismantle enemies in fast-paced encounters that reward timing, spacing, and control. Use everything you've got to complete your missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Build Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Knight\u2014body, weapons, and tuning. Each part affects how you fight and what you're capable of. Adapt your loadout, craft machines tailored to your playstyle and mission demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.poster.avif?t=1751368685\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.webm?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.mp4?t=1751368685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Code RAPID is a Third-Person Action Mecha game with the focus on real-time high-mobility movement. Fight on the Ondarean front to uncover mysteries of a forgotten planet. Complete missions to earn weapons and parts to build a mech that truly suits your playstyle with deep customization systems.",
